== membership takes the same hash path ==
L in dict => TypeError : cannot use 'L' as a dict key (unhashable type: 'L')
D in dict => TypeError : cannot use 'D' as a dict key (unhashable type: 'D')
== the report names the outermost key, the innermost unhashable ==
tuple(L) key => TypeError : cannot use 'tuple' as a dict key (unhashable type: 'L')
tuple(1, D) key => TypeError : cannot use 'tuple' as a dict key (unhashable type: 'D')
